---
/**
 * AboutContent — bilingual About body. Rendered on /about and /zh/about.
 *
 * Captures the origin story (why Human, exists), the four-pillar philosophy,
 * and a short note from Nico.
 */
import ApproachSection from '@components/ApproachSection.astro';
---
<ApproachSection background="warm">
  <div slot="en">
    <p class="label">About</p>
    <h1>An education collective for the age of AI.</h1>
    <p class="body-lg">
      In the age of AI, the most important question in education is no longer
      what children learn but how they stay human while learning. Human, is
      our answer.
    </p>
  </div>
  <div slot="zh">
    <p class="label">關於</p>
    <h1>為 AI 時代而生的共學社。</h1>
    <p class="body-lg">
      在 AI 的時代，教育最重要的問題已經不是孩子學什麼，而是他們在學習的過程裡，還能保有多少人的樣子。
      「人本」就是我們的回答。
    </p>
  </div>
</ApproachSection>

<ApproachSection>
  <div slot="en">
    <h2>Why "Human,"?</h2>
    <p>
      The comma is doing work. It's an opening, not a period. Being human
      is the beginning of something, not the end of a sentence. Everything
      we teach sits under that comma.
    </p>
    <p>
      The Chinese name is 人本・共學社. 人本 means human-centred, the human
      as the foundation of learning. 共學 means learning together. 社
      means a community with shared purpose.
    </p>
  </div>
  <div slot="zh">
    <h2>為什麼叫「Human,」？</h2>
    <p>
      那個逗號不是裝飾。它是一個開口，不是句點。「成為人」是開端，不是結尾。
      我們教的每一件事，都立在那個逗號底下。
    </p>
    <p>
      中文名「人本・共學社」，三個字各有分量：人本，是以人為本；共學，是一起學；社，是有共同目標的群體。
    </p>
  </div>
</ApproachSection>

<ApproachSection background="surface">
  <div slot="en">
    <h2>What we believe.</h2>
    <p>
      <strong>Process over product.</strong> We care more about the act of
      inquiry than the correct answer. Wonder, struggle, revise.
    </p>
    <p>
      <strong>Love is infrastructure.</strong> Children learn differently
      when they are deeply known. The relationship between teacher and
      student is not a soft benefit. It is the foundation everything is
      built on.
    </p>
    <p>
      <strong>Human first, tools second.</strong> Technology is welcome
      when it serves human development. We refuse it when it replaces the
      struggle that builds understanding.
    </p>
    <p>
      <strong>Learning is communal.</strong> The word "collective" is
      deliberate. Education happens between people, not between a person
      and a screen, and not in isolation.
    </p>
  </div>
  <div slot="zh">
    <h2>我們相信的事。</h2>
    <p>
      <strong>過程，比結果重要。</strong>我們在乎的是「想」的過程，而不是交出一個正確答案。
      好奇、卡住、修過去，才是真功夫。
    </p>
    <p>
      <strong>愛是基礎設施。</strong>被深深認識的孩子，學習方式會不一樣。
      師生之間的關係不是加分項，而是整個教學的根。
    </p>
    <p>
      <strong>先有人，再有工具。</strong>當科技能幫助人成長，我們歡迎它。
      當它拿走了那段「卡住又想通」的過程，我們拒絕它。
    </p>
    <p>
      <strong>學習是共同的事。</strong>「共學社」這三個字是認真選的。
      教育發生在人與人之間，不是人與螢幕之間，也不是一個人悶著頭學出來。
    </p>
  </div>
</ApproachSection>

<ApproachSection>
  <div slot="en">
    <h2>A note from Nico.</h2>
    <p>
      I've been a teacher long enough to know what I don't want to be. I
      don't want to be the person who hands a child an answer before they've
      had a chance to chase it. I don't want to be the one who grades a draft
      without reading it twice.
    </p>
    <p>
      Human, is the way I wish I'd been taught. It's also the way I think
      students need to be taught now, when a machine can write a passable
      essay in seconds. My job is to help students want to write a better one.
    </p>
  </div>
  <div slot="zh">
    <h2>來自 Nico 的一點話。</h2>
    <p>
      我當老師夠久了，久到很清楚我不想變成哪一種老師。
      我不想當那個在孩子還沒有機會追問之前，就把答案遞過去的人。
      我不想當那個草草看一次文章就給分的人。
    </p>
    <p>
      「人本」是我希望當年有人這樣教我。
      也是我相信在 AI 幾秒能寫出過得去的文章的今天，學生真正需要的教法。
      我的工作，是讓學生自己想寫出更好的那一篇。
    </p>
  </div>
</ApproachSection>
